Just a fancy new Alpha CPU.

I think there's a widespread misconception that great CPUs automatically
make great systems, or great customer solutions.  Silly idea, but the
trade press seems mostly  unwilling or unable to focus on the bigger
picture.

Even the people who talk to customers about my products like to lead with
Intel's latest CPU improvements.  Not HP's system or software improvements
that outnumber those in the CPU by probably a factor of 10 or more.

...

