It's a protection scheme so that VMS did not have to figure
out how to untie the knots in its BoMs.  All SDC had to do
is copy and ship one flavor of tape for any VMS distribution.
They left the Picking&Packing to software instead of the human
beings on the SDC floor.  VMS had to resort to using software
for this because marketing unbundled everything.  So dependencies
of X product on products A, B, C and W could be encoded and
listed on the customer invoice.  Humans used to manage this
dependency thing until every itty bitty piece of VMS was
unbundled.


